Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.29,0:23:23.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}In order to drop off the refugees,\Na ceasefire is declared.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.29,0:23:27.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, plans are put into place\Nfor the next round of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.63,0:23:32.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What will the mother and child\Nwitness on the Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.64,0:23:34.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.89,0:23:36.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Winds of War.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.39,0:23:40.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
